Exactly FOUR complete full-body game-animation poses in TWO COLUMNS TWO ROWS on SQUARE canvas. Every pose faces RIGHT in side/three-quarter view, eyes and front dagger directed right at opponent, while retreating BACKWARD toward LEFT. All same face/body scale, full feet hair and dagger tips inside separate cells with large transparent gutters.
Four-frame cautious backward shuffle, reading order:
0 rear/left foot probes backward toward left, weight on bent forward/right leg, torso compact;
1 rear foot plants farther left, weight shifts over it, forward heel lifts;
2 forward/right foot draws left a little, remaining clearly RIGHT of rear foot with a visible gap between legs, never crosses it;
3 forward foot plants again in a narrow but balanced alert guard to loop into0.
Maintain one short dagger at chest height ahead and the second lower near hip, guard steady. Her retreat is quick but careful, knees soft and both feet close to floor. Cape lags subtly right. Do not turn away, run forward, leap, cross feet or change weapons. Make support changes visible but keep head steady. No floor, shadows, labels, text, grid, motion blur, effects, stray fragments or extra limbs.
